E authoritative	7	2
E authoritative	1073741824	4
E with projections	7	2
E with projections	1073741824	4
-- C. a partition moved into another table, which has no conversion left to apply
C mutations at destination	0
C authoritative	1073741824	4
C with projections	1073741824	4
-- D. only the projection that reads the changed column is affected
D untouched projection	0	1
D untouched projection	1	1
D untouched projection	2	1
D untouched projection	3	1
D changed column authoritative	1073741824	4
D changed column with projections	1073741824	4
-- I. a normal projection sorted by an expression: its stored order can skip matching rows
I authoritative	4
I with projections	4
-- I2. a normal projection that cannot answer the query and is used only to prune parts: its
--     stored order prunes away the very parts that hold the matching rows
I2 control, projection prunes a part	1
I2 after the retype, projection prunes nothing	0
I2 authoritative	4
I2 with projections	4
