R with the projection	4	13
R with the projection	6	15
-- S. a normal projection whose sort key is a column the part does not record: the stored
--    copy and the order over it were both frozen under the type declared back then
S dt not stored by the part	1
S dt recorded by the projection	DateTime(\'UTC\')
S control, projection answers before the retype	4
