-- W. a normal projection storing a DEFAULT output whose input neither part records: the
--    stored value was computed while that input read as its old declaration, and no type on
--    disk says which one that was, so this shape is refused for the same reason as arm Q
W neither b nor c stored by the part	1
W c stored by the projection	c	UInt8
W projection rows	4
W authoritative	9	4
